          "cont": true,
          "open": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "lines": [
            "因为$\\sin\\alpha=\\frac{r}{2l}$，所以",
            "$F_{\\text{弹}}=\\frac{F}{\\sin\\alpha}=\\frac{F\\cdot2l}{r}↵=\\frac{q^2\\cdot2l}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0r^3}$，",
            "$F_{\\text{弹}}\\approx3.5\\times10^{-3}$牛顿."
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0160#2",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "box": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "cont": false,
          "open": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "lines": [
            "**细线的张力约**等于$3.5\\times10^{-3}$牛顿."
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0160#3",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "box": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "cont": false,
          "open": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "lines": [
            "4. 三个不大的带电体放在均匀电介质中的一条直线上，",
            "介电常数$\\varepsilon=2.1$. 带电量$q_2=1.0\\times10^{-8}$库仑的物体，放在带",
            "电量$q_1=-3.0\\times10^{-8}$库仑的物体(距离$r_{12}=0.4$米)和带电",
            "量$q_3=5.0\\times10^{-8}$库仑的物体(距离$r_{23}=0.6$米)之间. 试求",
            "每个物体所受库仑力的合力."
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0160#4",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "box": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "cont": false,
          "open": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "lines": [
            "解：根据库仑定律，第一个和第二个物体的相互吸引力",
            "为"
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0160#5",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "box": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "cont": false,
          "open": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "lines": [
            "$F_{12}=\\frac{|q_1|\\cdot|q_2|}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0\\varepsilon r_{12}^2}$."
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0160#6",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "box": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "cont": false,
          "open": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "lines": [
            "第二个和第三个物体相互排斥力为"
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0160#7",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "box": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "cont": false,
          "open": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "lines": [
            "$F_{23}=\\frac{|q_2|\\cdot|q_3|}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0\\varepsilon r_{23}^2}$."
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0160#8",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "box": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "cont": false,
          "open": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "lines": [
            "第一个和第三个物体相互吸引力为"
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0160#9",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "box": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "cont": false,
          "open": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "lines": [
            "$F_{13}=\\frac{|q_1|\\cdot|q_3|}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0\\varepsilon(r_{12}+r_{23})^2}$."
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0160#10",
          "kind": "p",
