          "lines": [
            "$F_1=F_{12}+F_{13}=\\frac{|q_1|}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0\\varepsilon}\\left(\\frac{|q_2|}{r_{12}^2}+\\frac{|q_3|}{r_{13}^2}\\right)$，"
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0161#3",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "box": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "cont": false,
          "open": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "lines": [
            "$F_1\\approx14.5\\times10^{-6}$牛顿."
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0161#4",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "box": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "cont": false,
          "open": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "lines": [
            "第二个物体所受的两个库仑力，也是同方向的(图109)，",
            "因此，合力的大小为："
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0161#5",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "box": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "cont": false,
          "open": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "lines": [
            "$F_2=F_{21}+F_{23}=\\frac{|q_2|}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0\\varepsilon}\\left(\\frac{|q_1|}{r_{12}^2}+\\frac{|q_3|}{r_{23}^2}\\right)$，"
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0161#6",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "box": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "cont": false,
          "open": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "lines": [
            "$F_2\\approx14.0\\times10^{-6}$牛顿."
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0161#7",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "box": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "cont": false,
          "open": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "lines": [
            "第三个物体所受的两个力，方向相反(图109). 第一个",
            "物体给它的吸引力$F_{31}$大于第二个物体给它的排斥力$F_{32}$. 合",
            "力的大小等于两个力的差. 合力的方向指向大的力："
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0161#8",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "box": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "cont": false,
          "open": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "lines": [
            "$F_3=F_{31}-F_{32}=\\frac{|q_3|}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0\\varepsilon}\\left(\\frac{|q_1|}{(r_{12}+r_{23})^2}-\\frac{|q_2|}{r_{23}^2}\\right)$，"
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0161#9",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "box": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "cont": false,
          "open": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "lines": [
            "$F_3\\approx0.5\\times10^{-6}$牛顿."
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0161#10",
          "kind": "exhead",
          "label": null,
          "box": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "cont": false,
          "open": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "lines": [
            "练习9"
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0161#11",
          "kind": "ex",
          "label": "1",
          "box": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "cont": false,
          "open": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "lines": [
            "1. 试举出你们在日常生活中所看到的物体起电的现象."
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0161#12",
          "kind": "ex",
          "label": "2",
          "box": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "cont": false,
          "open": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "lines": [
            "2. 大家知道，玻璃棒跟丝绸摩擦，玻璃棒带正电. 试用实验确定",
            "用毛皮摩擦的塑料钢笔杆带什么电."
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0161#13",
          "kind": "ex",
          "label": "3",
          "box": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "cont": false,
          "open": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "lines": [
            "3. 胶木棒由于摩擦带负电. 棒的质量改变不改变？"
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0161#14",
          "kind": "ex",
          "label": "4",
          "box": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "cont": false,
          "open": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "lines": [
            "4. 带电的验电器，经过相当长的时间后不带电了. 是否意味着电",
            "荷消失得无影无踪？"
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0161#15",
          "kind": "ex",
          "label": "5",
          "box": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "cont": false,
          "open": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "lines": [
            "5. 为什么理发师主要用金属的梳子，而不用塑料梳子？"
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0161#16",
          "kind": "ex",
          "label": "6",
          "box": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "cont": false,
          "open": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "lines": [
            "6. 两个物体紧密接触时，没有摩擦也产生不太明显的起电，这是",
            "否意味着没有做功，也能得到两个带电的物体？"
          ]
        },
        {
          "ref": "p0161#17",
          "kind": "ex",
          "label": "7",
          "box": null,
          "owner_exercise": null,
          "cont": false,
          "open": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "lines": [
            "7. 如果氢原子中的电子和原子核之间的距离等于$0.5\\times10^{-8}$厘",
            "米，试求它们之间的相互作用力."
          ]
        },
